choices "94958314-e61e-5bf1-8dcc-1d3bc80aae10"] [:db/add "ceba9a59-1397-5b29-af02-48b0b786f444" :answer-field/choices "284e6ee1-1ac2-55ed-bc78-77df29e3caf4"] [:db/add "ceba9a59-1397-5b29-af02-48b0b786f444" :answer-field/choices "030a81e9-4665-50e2-b467-afaba0c4c432"] [:db/add "ceba9a59-1397-5b29-af02-48b0b786f444" :answer-field/choices "e42e1151-af7d-5fbe-8f03-aad5d113ab49"] [:db/add "ceba9a59-1397-5b29-af02-48b0b786f444" :answer-field/choices "f3118d21-2cfb-5a5a-aeba-4b9031e501e1"] [:db/add "ceba9a59-1397-5b29-af02-48b0b786f444" :answer-field/correct "e42e1151-af7d-5fbe-8f03-aad5d113ab49"] [:db/ensure "ceba9a59-1397-5b29-af02-48b0b786f444" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb" :question/id #uuid "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb"] [:db/add "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nWork on intervals where $x>0$ and $y>0$, and where the displayed coefficients are defined.\n\n- **I.** $y' + 5 \\cdot x^{3} \\cdot y = - \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{y}}$\n- **II.** $y' - 3 \\cdot y \\cdot \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} = 3 \\cdot y^{2} \\cdot \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$\n- **III.** $y' + 3 \\cdot y = \\frac{\\sec{\\left(x \\right)}}{y^{2}}$"] [:db/add "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb" :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=q(x)y^n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation I is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=5 \\cdot x^{3},\\quad q(x)=-3,\\quad n=- \\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\n- Equation II is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=- 3 \\cdot \\sin{\\left(x \\right)},\\quad q(x)=3 \\cdot \\cos{\\left(x \\right)},\\quad n=2.\n$$\n\n- Equation III is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=3,\\quad q(x)=\\sec{\\left(x \\right)},\\quad n=-2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, select I, II, III."] [:db/add "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb" :question/answer-fields "ceba9a59-1397-5b29-af02-48b0b786f444"] [:db/ensure "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/questions "73ce47a4-dc74-5871-92a5-d4898e496acb"] [:db/add "0a6a9886-d056-5f56-b96d-110a66150149" :answer/id #uuid "0a6a9886-d056-5f56-b96d-110a66150149"] [:db/add "0a6a9886-d056-5f56-b96d-110a66150149" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "0a6a9886-d056-5f56-b96d-110a66150149" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "0a6a9886-d056-5f56-b96d-110a66150149" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aa20897a-ed31-593d-be0d-e229b82e4d48" :answer/id #uuid "aa20897a-ed31-593d-be0d-e229b82e4d48"] [:db/add "aa20897a-ed31-593d-be0d-e229b82e4d48" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "aa20897a-ed31-593d-be0d-e229b82e4d48" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "aa20897a-ed31-593d-be0d-e229b82e4d48" :answer/validate] [:db/add "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1" :answer-field/id #uuid "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1"] [:db/add "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1" :answer-field/key "I"] [:db/add "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1" :answer-field/choices "0a6a9886-d056-5f56-b96d-110a66150149"] [:db/add "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1" :answer-field/choices "aa20897a-ed31-593d-be0d-e229b82e4d48"] [:db/add "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1" :answer-field/correct "0a6a9886-d056-5f56-b96d-110a66150149"] [:db/ensure "902c375f-f748-5a4d-a548-dbdefc54c9c1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "63425b5c-327c-5bff-8c43-f4ed8cc6fafb" :answer/id #uuid "63425b5c-327c-5bff-8c43-f4ed8cc6fafb"] [:db/add "63425b5c-327c-5bff-8c43-f4ed8cc6fafb" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "63425b5c-327c-5bff-8c43-f4ed8cc6fafb" :answ