the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation I is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\n- Equation II is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=- 5 \\cdot e^{x},\\quad q(x)=5 \\cdot x^{2},\\quad n=5.\n$$\n\n- Equation III is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=5 \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)},\\quad q(x)=- 4 \\cdot x,\\quad n=3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, select II, III."] [:db/add "5d6b9022-4038-5f9b-8090-82516cbd2571" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5d6b9022-4038-5f9b-8090-82516cbd2571" :question/answer-fields "636959c7-1b48-5464-b4b0-ce15dc99082e"] [:db/add "5d6b9022-4038-5f9b-8090-82516cbd2571" :question/answer-fields "e9f70a37-68e3-594b-a529-75a57129f8f2"] [:db/add "5d6b9022-4038-5f9b-8090-82516cbd2571" :question/answer-fields "292e9625-d748-52d4-951d-1d9b0ac9b7fa"] [:db/add "5d6b9022-4038-5f9b-8090-82516cbd2571" :question/answer-fields "47a806a8-617e-5895-a9cf-aa3eb7833c82"] [:db/ensure "5d6b9022-4038-5f9b-8090-82516cbd2571" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/questions "5d6b9022-4038-5f9b-8090-82516cbd2571"] [:db/add "70022836-b0a7-5c92-b7ec-0df36738adb4" :answer/id #uuid "70022836-b0a7-5c92-b7ec-0df36738adb4"] [:db/add "70022836-b0a7-5c92-b7ec-0df36738adb4" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "70022836-b0a7-5c92-b7ec-0df36738adb4" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "70022836-b0a7-5c92-b7ec-0df36738adb4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5dc43b78-2837-523c-83cb-aeb11236da9e" :answer/id #uuid "5dc43b78-2837-523c-83cb-aeb11236da9e"] [:db/add "5dc43b78-2837-523c-83cb-aeb11236da9e" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "5dc43b78-2837-523c-83cb-aeb11236da9e" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "5dc43b78-2837-523c-83cb-aeb11236da9e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "68139657-37fb-5b7f-8bc3-a31a0439a6b6" :answer-fie